    (∀ v ∈ offHyp S U, v ∉ K → f j v = 0) → (∀ v ∈ offHyp S U, v ∈ K → ‖f j v‖ * poinWt S v (u j) ≤ c) →
    (∀ v ∈ offHyp S U, v ∈ K → ∀ i b, ‖dbar (f i) v (coordVec b)‖ * (poinWt S v (u i) * poinWt S v b) ≤ c) →
